triage:C2_QA1_REQ_C2_006 a triage:Finding ;
 triage:id "REQ-C2-006" ;
 triage:severity "Blocking" ;
 triage:reviewer "req-qa" ;
 triage:status "open" ;
 triage:reviewed_commit "e4f01c5d160be7025ad1a6e22dd97676940b1be1" ;
 triage:file "crates/sc-cron/src/consumer_contract.rs:15; crates/sc-cron/src/consumer_contract.rs:79" ;
 triage:issue "The inherited normal-feature public contract requires StoreOperationContext when composing an application-owned CronOperations provider, but its fields are private and the only worker-free constructor in this baseline is cfg(test-utils). A production custom provider cannot construct the required context through the supported ordinary-build API. Future C5 worker-based construction does not supply the promised independent override path." ;
 triage:action "Freeze and provide the minimal production context/ownership composition seam for application-owned operations without requiring a dummy framework worker or test-utils; document cancellation, earliest-deadline and physical-ownership duties and prove an ordinary-feature external consumer. Merge the corrected contract baseline into C2." ;
 triage:verification_source "https://github.com/randlee/sc-runtime/pull/119#issuecomment-6662398454" .

